WEBVTT

00:00:00.381 --> 00:00:01.505
An older parent.

00:00:01.825 --> 00:00:02.781
A new baby.

00:00:03.049 --> 00:00:04.662
Recovery after surgery.

00:00:04.982 --> 00:00:06.544
Care changes every day.

00:00:06.973 --> 00:00:08.225
An appointment moves.

00:00:08.545 --> 00:00:09.759
The ride doesn't.

00:00:10.066 --> 00:00:11.769
Everyone has part of the story.

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:15.708
Carestead brings the plan and people into one shared care

00:00:15.718 --> 00:00:16.287
picture.

00:00:16.698 --> 00:00:17.821
Review the change.

00:00:18.154 --> 00:00:19.755
Update the shared plan.

00:00:20.061 --> 00:00:23.170
See what still needs attention, with you in control.

00:00:23.661 --> 00:00:26.189
Just ten minutes from you can mean so much to

00:00:26.199 --> 00:00:27.658
someone who needs support.

00:00:28.049 --> 00:00:28.877
Carestead.

00:00:29.157 --> 00:00:31.595
Less to carry, more care to give.
